flowchart LR
  A["outside the bracket:<br/>it acts on the output,<br/>and reads as written"]
  A --> B["f(x) + c slides<br/>the graph up by c"]
  B --> C["a f(x) stretches it<br/>away from the x-axis"]
  D["inside the bracket:<br/>it acts on the input,<br/>and reads backwards"]
  D --> E["f(x - c) slides<br/>the graph RIGHT by c"]
  E --> F["f(a x) squashes it<br/>towards the y-axis"]
